+	  Digital to Analog Converters:
+	  - AD3530/AD3530R (8-channel)
+	  - AD3531/AD3531R (4-channel)
+	  - AD3532/AD3532R (16-channel)
 
 	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
 	  module will be called ad3530r.
