+/**
+ * Request INTEL_SIP_SMC_ASYNC_HWMON_READTEMP
+ * Async call to request temperature
+ *
+ * Call register usage:
+ * a0 INTEL_SIP_SMC_ASYNC_HWMON_READTEMP
+ * a1 transaction job id
+ * a2 Temperature Channel
+ * a3-a17 not used
+ *
