 Changes in v11:
  - Fix to return -EINVAL if WARN_ON_ONCE() is hit.
 Changes in v6:
  - Add a WARN_ON_ONCE check for leaking nested_level (it must not happen.)
 Changes in v4:
  - Use orig_offset for reporting NO_PTR_STRCT error.
 Changes in v2:
  - Fix to skip "->" after closing parenthetsis.
